# --- Build output and generated reports ---
# `target/` also covers every generated report: surefire, failsafe, JaCoCo, the CycloneDX SBOM and the
# OWASP Dependency-Check output, all of which are written under it. Generated reports are release
# evidence, never tracked source.
target/
.mvn/timing.properties
.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar

# --- Runtime evidence storage ---
# Anchored to the repository root: this is the local evidence directory created by the `local`
# profile. Unanchored, the pattern also matched the `evidence/storage` source package and silently
# excluded every new file added to it.
/storage/

# --- Secrets and local environment ---
# `.env.example` is tracked on purpose: it is the placeholder-only reference, and no value in it is usable.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# --- Logs ---
*.log

# --- Database dumps and archives produced by backup or restore runs ---
*.dump
*.sql.gz
*.tar.gz

# --- Local Postman / Newman run state ---
# The delivered collection and the placeholder-only environment under `postman/` are tracked source and
# are deliberately not matched here. Only run output is ignored.
newman/
postman/newman/

# --- Temporary and editor files ---
*.tmp
*.bak
*~
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
.DS_Store
